### 1. 회원가입 성공 (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "umc@example.com",
  "password": "Umc!1234",
  "nickname": "moviefan"
}

### 2. 검증 실패: 이메일 형식 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "Umc!1234",
  "nickname": "moviefan2"
}

### 3. 중복 이메일 (409, MEMBER4091)
POST http://localhost:8080/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "umc@example.com",
  "password": "Umc!1234",
  "nickname": "another"
}

### 4. 중복 닉네임 (409, MEMBER4092)
POST http://localhost:8080/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "other@example.com",
  "password": "Umc!1234",
  "nickname": "moviefan"
}

### 5. 평점 등록 (201) - memberId는 가입 응답의 값으로 바꿔서 사용
POST http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 603,
  "score": 5,
  "comment": "인생 영화"
}

### 6. 같은 영화 중복 평점 (409)
POST http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 603,
  "score": 4
}

### 7. 별점 범위 초과 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": 604,
  "score": 6
}

### 8. 평점 수정 (200) - ratingId는 등록 응답의 값
PATCH http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 4,
  "comment": "다시 보니 4점"
}

### 9. 다른 회원이 수정 (403)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/members/2/ratings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 1
}

### 10. 존재하지 않는 평점 수정 (404)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 3
}

### 11. 평점 삭제 (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings/1

### 12. 삭제 후 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/members/1/ratings
